<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Lineage 2 defeated. Its attacks were sized by calculation; a changed number changed the outcome.<\gray>
?else
<gray>Lineage 2 attacked with the number it calculated and the number was right.<\gray>
?end
<blue>Log entry: lineage selection continuing. Held-out fitness against the full field is falling, not rising: each lineage is harder to beat only for the one that bred it.<\blue>
